-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-6","children":"Project Estimates"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Any estimates provided are based on our assessment of the work required and are subject to change if additional issues are discovered during the service. We will communicate any significant changes before proceeding with additional work."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-6","children":"Payment"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Payment terms will be specified in your service agreement or contract. Unless otherwise stated, payment is due upon completion of the service. We accept various payment methods, including credit cards, checks, and electronic transfers."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-6","children":"Warranties and Guarantees"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We stand behind our work and provide warranties on our services. The specific warranty terms vary by service type and will be provided in writing at the time of service. Manufacturer warranties apply to products and equipment installed by Saddlewood Contracting LLC."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-6","children":"Liability Limitations"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Saddlewood Contracting LLC is not liable for:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc ml-6 mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Damages resulting from pre-existing conditions not caused by our services"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Damages caused by third parties"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Incidental or consequential damages"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Acts of nature or conditions beyond our control"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-6","children":"Consumer Rights"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"These Terms and Conditions do not affect your statutory rights as a consumer under applicable federal, state, or local laws."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-6","children":"Property Access and Preparation"}],["$","p",null,{"children":